Package: micomposition
Title: Visualization Tools for Microbiome Composition Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Axel", "Guo", , "377174147@qq.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A toolkit for visualizing microbiome composition data from 
    16S rRNA amplicon sequencing or metagenomic studies. Supports stacked 
    bar charts, treemaps, sunburst plots, and Voronoi diagrams.
